{"narrative":"You jolt awake strapped sideways into a crash couch, the world canted at a sick angle. Red emergency strobes throb through choking gray smoke, painting the torn shuttle interior in frantic pulses of color. Heat slams into you from the rear where the engine compartment roars, metal shrieking and popping as something structural gives way.

To your left, Dr. Mira Orvaine fumbles with her restraints, coughing hard, eyes wide and unfocused behind a sheen of sweat. Vriktik, all angular chitin and twitching antennae, is already halfway free, chittering sharp curses as he kicks at a warped panel. Squelb, bulbous skin glistening with stress-sweat, whimpers about "cargo indemnity" while the smell of burning plastics and ionized air grows thicker.

You can feel the hull open somewhere behind you, a ragged breach that howls with thin alien wind. Fire races along exposed cabling toward a ruptured fuel line, the heat climbing from uncomfortable to lethal in heartbeats. If protocol says wait for rescue, your gut says there will not be anyone left to rescue unless you move now.","dice_rolls":[],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":"Woke in a crashed shuttle with three survivors and a spreading engine fire. Hull is breached, atmosphere leaking. Need to escape the wreck immediately.","scene_id":"the_wreck"},"choices":[{"id":"free_mira_first","text":"Unbuckle and drag Dr. Orvaine free, prioritizing the medic before the fire reaches you both.","action_type":"narrative"},{"id":"breach_exit","text":"Ignore the others for a moment and push toward the screaming hull breach to find or force an exit route.","action_type":"narrative"},{"id":"jury_rig_firebreak","text":"Trust your unconventional instincts: rip down loose panels and debris to improvise a quick firebreak or shield so everyone can reach an exit together.","action_type":"narrative"},{"id":"bark_orders","text":"Snap into command mode, shouting crisp orders to Vriktik and Squelb to free themselves and find tools while you assess the fastest way out.","action_type":"narrative"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":"The Wreck","scene_summary":"Kael regains consciousness in a crashed shuttle filling with smoke and heat. Three survivors are trapped with him and the engine fire is spreading toward a fuel rupture. The hull is breached and an exit must be found quickly.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":[]}

{"narrative":"You brace against the canted shuttle floor and push through a curtain of hot smoke. Red emergency lights stutter over torn seats and sparking conduit, turning the cabin into a butcher's lantern. The hull breach ahead leaks a screaming draft, and beyond it you can see a wash of brutal purple daylight over jagged stone.

Dr. Orvaine coughs hard and fumbles for her medkit, eyes wide with panic. Vriktik is already half inside an access panel, mandibles clicking as he gauges the fire's spread, while Squelb clutches a bent cargo strap and babbles about salvage rights even now. Near the broken bulkhead, a crate has jammed against the breach, slowing the airflow just enough to form a narrow escape route, and the kind of ugly, improvised path that seems made for you.

The engine fire gives a hungry roar from the rear compartment. Heat builds fast, metal pops overhead, and every second in here tastes like burnt plastic and blood. You need a way out, and you need these three moving before the wreck decides for everyone.","dice_rolls":[],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":"You awaken in the crashed shuttle and spot a possible escape route through the breached hull as fire spreads.","scene_id":"The Wreck"},"choices":[{"id":"lead_survivors_breach","text":"Force the crate wider and lead everyone out through the breached hull into the purple daylight","action_type":"move"},{"id":"help_vriktik_improvise","text":"Join Vriktik at the access panel and improvise a way to slow the fire before evacuating","action_type":"improvise"},{"id":"send_orvaine_squelb","text":"Order Dr. Orvaine and Squelb to crawl out first while you cover the cabin and check for anything left behind","action_type":"command"},{"id":"grab_essential_gear","text":"Use the chaos to snatch any useful supplies from the wreck before the flames take them","action_type":"scavenge"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":"The Wreck","scene_summary":"The shuttle lies on its side, burning and breached. Three shaken survivors look to you as a narrow escape route reveals itself.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":["breached hull","Vriktik","Dr. Orvaine","Squelb","improvise"]}

{"narrative":"You move aft with your weapon raised, boots slipping on shredded insulation and cracked deck plating. Smoke stings your eyes, hot metal and chemical coolant biting the air, while the tapping grows louder through the wreck’s ribs. The corridor bends toward the engine section, and you catch a second sound now, something wet and deliberate, like breathing through a broken mask.

Dr. Orvaine is behind you somewhere, coughing. Vriktik’s voice snaps out from the smoke, low and clipped, warning you not to trust any sound in a hull this torn. Squelb is already talking to nobody, as if negotiation might impress whatever is stalking the dark, which would be funny if it were not so painfully stupid.

At the far bend, a maintenance hatch hangs half-open, and pale light leaks through from below. You can force it, bait whatever is inside, or use the wreck itself to get an angle no one expects. What do you do?","dice_rolls":[],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":"You move aft through the burning wreck toward a tapping sound and something that may be breathing.","scene_id":null},"choices":[{"id":"force_hatch","text":"Force the maintenance hatch and take whatever is below by surprise","action_type":"skill_or_stat"},{"id":"bait_ambush","text":"Use noise and movement to draw the sound into the open","action_type":"creative"},{"id":"find_angle","text":"Climb over the wreckage and look for a better firing angle","action_type":"creative"},{"id":"call_out","text":"Shout for the others to cover you and coordinate a push","action_type":"social"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":null,"scene_summary":"Kael advances aft through the burning shuttle toward an unsettling tapping sound and possible movement behind a maintenance hatch.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":["maintenance hatch","energy weapons","cover","initiative"]}

{"narrative":"The acrid scent of burning insulation fills your lungs, and the red emergency lights pulse like a dying heart. You move toward the rear, boots skidding on the tilted deck as fire licks at the engine bulkhead. The rhythmic tapping is louder here, a frantic metallic sound coming from behind the buckled hatch of the maintenance crawlspace.

Vriktik, the krix engineer, is pulling at the emergency lever, but the mechanism is fused by the intense heat. He yells that the fuel cells are destabilizing and that you need to leave now, his multifaceted eyes wide with panic. Nearby, Dr. Orvaine is trying to drag the merchant Squelb toward the hull breach, but the merchant is frozen in shock, clutching his singed robes.

You spot a ruptured coolant line spraying a fine mist of liquid nitrogen near the glowing hot door hinges. Protocol says stay clear of pressurized leaks, but you see a way to use that thermal shock to your advantage. The metal is screaming under the stress, and the tapping from the other side has turned into a desperate muffled shouting.","dice_rolls":[{"description":"Listen for life signs through the chaos","target":40,"roll":22,"success":true,"rule_source":"INT check"}],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":"The shuttle crashed. Someone is trapped in the crawlspace near the failing engines.","scene_id":"shuttle_wreck_aft"},"choices":[{"id":"sig_trait_coolant","text":"[Signature Trait] Use the coolant mist to flash-freeze the red-hot hinges and shatter the lock.","action_type":"signature_trait"},{"id":"force_hatch","text":"Brute force the buckled hatch with your shoulder.","action_type":"stat_check"},{"id":"vibe_pry","text":"Use your Vibe Knife to wedge the seal and pry the door open.","action_type":"skill_check"},{"id":"evac_others","text":"Ignore the tapping and force Vriktik and Squelb out the hull breach.","action_type":"narrative"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":null,"scene_summary":"Trapped in the burning shuttle wreck. Someone is behind a jammed door in the engine section.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":[]}

{"narrative":"You raise your sidearm and step into the gloom, your boots crunching on icy deck plates. The stench of ozone and scorched wiring hangs heavy in the stagnant air. Every nine seconds, the distress beacon sends a vibration through the hull, punctuated by the metallic tapping from the aft junction.

Rounding a buckled support beam, you spot a shadowy figure crouched beside a flickering terminal. It is Vessa Tor, the freighter's second mate. Her visor is thick with frost, and her hands tremble as she fruitlessly jams a bypass chip into a dead conduit. She spins toward you, leveling a glowing plasma cutter with wide, panicked eyes.

Behind her, a ruptured coolant line is venting super-cooled gas across the hatch, rapidly locking the emergency seal under thick black ice. Standard safety protocol dictates evacuating and sealing this entire corridor, but doing so would trap her and lock off access to the lower holds forever.","dice_rolls":[{"description":"Intuition check to spot the hazardous coolant line before stepping into the breach","target":40,"roll":22,"success":true,"rule_source":"Astra Rising Core Core Rules"}],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[{"id":"Vessa Tor","disposition":"Fearful"}],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":null,"scene_id":null},"choices":[{"id":"calm_vessa","text":"Lower your sidearm and talk Vessa down before she fires out of panic.","action_type":"social"},{"id":"thermal_bypass","text":"[Signature Trait] Rig the thermal exhaust on your laser pistol to blast concentrated heat into the hatch mechanism, thawing it instantly.","action_type":"signature_trait"},{"id":"vibe_lever","text":"Jam your vibe knife into the manual override gear to force the hatch open with high-frequency vibrations.","action_type":"item_use"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":"FREIGHTER CORRIDOR - AFT JUNCTION","scene_summary":"Investigated the aft corridor sound and found Vessa Tor attempting to open a rapidly freezing bulkhead hatch.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":[]}

{"narrative":"You raise your weapon, thumbing the safety off as your boots crunch over icy deck plating. The air is foul with stale scrubber ozone and cold void-chill. The tapping grows louder as you move down the dark gangway, leading toward a half-jammed maintenance hatch near the primary engine manifold.

Nothing is breathing, at least not with lungs like yours. As your barrel sweeps the threshold, you spot a severed power conduit bouncing rhythmically against the loose panel, casting violent blue sparks into the gloom. Right beside it sits a heavily reinforced cargo locker, its electronic lock fried by the power surge but its structure intact.

While a technician might waste hours searching for a power node, those live sparks give you an opening. You could jury-rig a dangerous electrical arc to blow the lock open instantly, or stick to brute force and search the deeper compartments.","dice_rolls":[{"description":"Intuition check to sense threats in the dark","target":40,"roll":32,"success":true,"rule_source":"Astra Rising Core Core Rules"}],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":null,"scene_id":null},"choices":[{"id":"choice_1_signature","text":"Jury-rig the sparking conduit to short-circuit the locker lock.","action_type":"signature_trait"},{"id":"choice_2_pry","text":"Pry the locker door open using your vibe knife.","action_type":"physical"},{"id":"choice_3_bypass","text":"Bypass the locker and press deeper toward the cargo hold.","action_type":"explore"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":null,"scene_summary":"Investigating the tapping sound aft near the engine manifold.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":[]}

{"narrative":"Acrid smoke stings your throat and fills the narrow corridor. The red emergency lights flicker rhythmically, casting long, twitching shadows against the dented bulkheads. 

You move with practiced caution, your weapon held tight as the tapping grows louder. A loose ventilation grate rattles against its frame, sounding like frantic fingers drumming on metal.

Dr. Orvaine crawls past you, coughing violently while clutching her medical kit. Vriktik is already halfway down the hall, his mandibles clicking in a sharp, rhythmic distress signal.","dice_rolls":[],"state_updates":{"stamina_delta":0,"seu_delta":0,"seu_source":null,"ammo_updates":{},"status_add":[],"status_remove":[],"inventory_add":[],"inventory_remove":[],"xp_delta":0,"credits_delta":0,"npc_updates":[],"faction_updates":[],"journal_entry":null,"scene_id":null},"choices":[{"id":"search_vent","text":"Investigate the rattling vent for threats","action_type":"skill_check"},{"id":"help_orvaine","text":"Assist the doctor before moving forward","action_type":"social_check"},{"id":"follow_vriktik","text":"Push past the others to scout ahead","action_type":"movement"}],"scene_change":false,"scene_header":null,"scene_summary":"Moving aft toward the tapping sound in the smoke-filled corridor.","combat_state_update":null,"ooc_note":null,"tooltip_terms":[]}
